---
import { Gallery } from "@/components/Gallery";
import DocsLayout from "@/layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="문서" landing>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-glow"></div>
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> @kokoa/clotho</p>
      <h1><em>JSON</em>으로 복잡한 흐름을 움직이세요.</h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">Clotho는 알고리즘과 시스템의 동작을 시간에 따라 표현하는 애니메이션 도구입니다. 같은 문서를 웹 player, SVG, GIF와 시각 편집기에서 그대로 사용합니다.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="primary-action" href="/docs/getting-started">문서 시작하기 <span>→</span></a>
        <a class="secondary-action" href="https://clotho-editor.shinkeonkim.com/">Editor에서 만들어보기</a>
      </div>
      <div class="capabilities">
        <div><strong>10</strong><span>표현 요소</span></div><div><strong>8</strong><span>진입·퇴장 방식</span></div><div><strong>6</strong><span>rendering 환경</span></div><div><strong>1</strong><span>공통 JSON Schema</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="gallery-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div><p>공식 Gallery</p><h2>기능을 설명보다 먼저 확인하세요.</h2></div>
      <p>각 예시는 실제 Clotho JSON을 사용합니다. 재생하고 시간을 옮겨본 뒤 원본 문서도 바로 열어볼 수 있습니다.</p>
    </div>
    <Gallery client:load />
  </section>
</DocsLayout>

<style>
  .hero { position: relative; padding: 104px 24px 82px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e9ef; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% -20%, #ebeaff 0, #fafaff 38%, #fff 72%); text-align: center; }
  .hero-glow { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 52px; width: 420px; height: 240px; transform: translateX(-50%); border-radius: 50%; background: #7770ff24; filter: blur(75px); pointer-events: none; }
  .hero-inner { position: relative; max-width: 1320px; margin: auto; }
  .eyebrow { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: 0 0 24px; padding: 7px 12px; border: 1px solid #dcdaf9; border-radius: 999px; color: #554fe0; background: #ffffffa8; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
  .eyebrow span { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #6c65ff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #6c65ff1c; }
  h1 { margin: 0; color: #171a24; font-size: min(4vw, 4rem); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -.05em; white-space: nowrap; }
  h1 em { color: #625bf5; font-style: normal; }
  .hero-copy { max-width: 720px; margin: 30px auto 0; color: #626a7b; font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.25rem); line-height: 1.75; word-break: keep-all; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 34px; }
  .hero-actions a { padding: 13px 19px; border-radius: 11px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  .primary-action { color: white; background: #5e57ed; box-shadow: 0 10px 28px #5e57ed38; }
  .primary-action span { margin-left: 12px; }
  .secondary-action { color: #363b49; border: 1px solid #dcdfe7; background: #fff; }
  .capabilities { max-width: 760px; margin: 66px auto 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); border: 1px solid #e4e5ec; border-radius: 16px; background: #ffffffb5; box-shadow: 0 14px 40px #25294a0b; }
  .capabilities div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; padding: 20px 10px; border-right: 1px solid #e8e9ef; }
  .capabilities div:last-child { border: 0; }.capabilities strong { font-size: 21px; }.capabilities span { color: #7a8190; font-size: 12px; }
  .gallery-section { max-width: 1160px; margin: auto; padding: 88px 24px 100px; }
  .section-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr; gap: 60px; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 38px; }
  .section-heading p { margin: 0; color: #6c7383; line-height: 1.7; word-break: keep-all; }.section-heading > div > p { margin-bottom: 8px; color: #625bf5; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 750; }.section-heading h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
  :global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .hero { border-color: #292d37; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% -20%, #28254c 0, #15161d 42%, #101217 75%); }
  :global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .eyebrow { border-color: #39365f; background: #1b1a28; color: #b5b1ff; }
  :global(html[data-theme="dark"]) h1 { color: #f4f5f8; }
  :global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .hero-copy, :global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .section-heading p { color: #a7adba; }
  :global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .secondary-action { color: #edf1f7; border-color: #343844; background: #191c23; }
  :global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .capabilities { border-color: #30333d; background: #171920cc; }
  :global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .capabilities div { border-color: #30333d; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .hero { padding-top: 72px; }.hero-actions { flex-direction: column; }.capabilities { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }.capabilities div:nth-child(2) { border-right: 0; }.capabilities div:nth-child(-n+2) { border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e9ef; }.section-heading { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 18px; } }
</style>
